════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                         PLAYWRIGHT RUN COMMANDS
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

═══════════════════════════════════════
 GENERAL COMMANDS
═══════════════════════════════════════

Run all tests (all projects):
  npx playwright test

Run only on Chromium:
  npx playwright test --project=chromium

Run only on Firefox:
  npx playwright test --project=firefox

Run only on WebKit (Safari):
  npx playwright test --project=webkit

Run on mobile Chrome:
  npx playwright test --project=mobile-chrome

Run on mobile Safari:
  npx playwright test --project=mobile-safari

Run on tablet:
  npx playwright test --project=tablet

Run API tests:
  npx playwright test --project=api

Run visual tests:
  npx playwright test --project=visual

Run headed (see browser):
  npx playwright test --project=chromium --headed

Run with debug (step by step):
  npx playwright test --project=chromium --debug


═══════════════════════════════════════
 ENVIRONMENT COMMANDS
═══════════════════════════════════════

Run on Angular Staging:
  $env:UI_FRAMEWORK="angular"; $env:TEST_ENV="staging"; npx playwright test --project=chromium

Run on Angular Production:
  $env:UI_FRAMEWORK="angular"; $env:TEST_ENV="production"; npx playwright test --project=chromium

Run on React Staging:
  $env:UI_FRAMEWORK="react"; $env:TEST_ENV="staging"; npx playwright test --project=chromium

Run on React Production:
  $env:UI_FRAMEWORK="react"; $env:TEST_ENV="production"; npx playwright test --project=chromium


